WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.621
What to take into the project.

2
00:00:01.901 --> 00:00:10.669
Write the trifecta down for your agent before you write code: which tools give private data, which give untrusted content, which can send data out.

3
00:00:10.949 --> 00:00:24.304
Then choose one structural defense (a leg removed, a map-reduce reader, or a fixed action plan), one deterministic guard (allowlists plus a data-flow rule), and one human step (approve the drafted report).

4
00:00:24.584 --> 00:00:28.147
Finally, write the injection fixtures before you trust any of it.

5
00:00:28.427 --> 00:00:34.187
You’ll reuse the lab’s suite format, and lesson 12 shows how to fold it into your agent’s eval set.
